1. Creating the Script and Sample Files
   touch emails.txt
   touch emailcleaner.sh

2. Editing the Script and Sample Files
  a.nano emailcleaner.sh
    Code:
      #!/bin/bash
      grep -E '^[a-zA-Z0-9]+@[a-zA-Z]+\.com$' emails.txt | sort | uniq > valid.txt
      grep -v -E '^[a-zA-Z0-9]+@[a-zA-Z]+\.com$' emails.txt > invalid.txt
  b.nano emails.txt
        abc@gmail.com
        test@site.com
        user22@yahoo.com
        bad@email

3. Setting Executable Permissions
    chmod +x emailcleaner.sh

4. Running the script
    ./emailcleaner.sh

5. Verify
   cat valid.txt
   cat invalid.txt
